msgstr "机架类型与型号配置"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:8
#: e6d6a9b65a4a42ffbea5caaf953171cc
msgid "MultiCopters"
msgstr "多旋翼"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:10
#: 942db71d1ef044df9308142192cc7bd1
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` and :ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_TYPE>` "
"parameters should be set to match the physical frame being used.  See the "
":ref:`Connect ESCs and Motors <connect-escs-and-motors>` page for the list "
"of supported multicopter frames"
msgstr ""
"应将 :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 和 :ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_TYPE>` "
"参数设置为与所用实际机架匹配。支持的多旋翼机架列表请参见 :ref:`连接 ESC 和电机 <connect-escs-and-motors>` 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:12
#: 6268b92e7f4b4935b734d70126ed8fca
msgid ""
"If using the mission planner select Initial Setup, **Mandatory Hardware \\| "
"Frame Type**.  If you are using another Ground Station it should be possible"
" to set the :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` and :ref:`FRAME_TYPE "
"<FRAME_TYPE>` parameters directly through a parameter update screen."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Mission Planner，请选择 Initial Setup，**Mandatory Hardware \\| Frame "
"Type**。如果使用其他地面站，应可通过参数更新界面直接设置 :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 和 "
":ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_TYPE>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:19
#: 7930e3615d804629a4f2f77efe5af22f
msgid ""
"For Traditional Helicopters, \"Heli\" should already be selected and it "
"should not be changed. For :ref:`Single Copter and Coax Copter "
"<singlecopter-and-coaxcopter>` the :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` "
"parameter should be set directly from the Full Parameter List until `this "
"issue <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/issues/1552>`__ is "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"对于传统直升机，应已选择\"Heli\"且不应更改。对于 :ref:`单旋翼和同轴双旋翼 <singlecopter-and-"
"coaxcopter>`，:ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 参数应直接从完整参数列表设置，直到 `此问题 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/issues/1552>`__ 得到解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:22
#: 7f2fa49a02364f829c7cdc23da20a4a7
msgid ""
"Next select the frame \"Type\" for your vehicle. The default type is **X**."
msgstr "接下来为您的飞行器选择机架\"类型\"。默认类型为 **X**。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:24
#: 4d89509cdc654dd6bd820ce1fc2db320
msgid ""
"For Tricopters, Y6, Traditional Helicopters, Bicopters, SingleCopters and "
"CoaxCopters the frame type is ignored."
msgstr "对于三旋翼、Y6、传统直升机、双旋翼、单旋翼和同轴双旋翼，机架类型被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:27
