msgid "Motor Order Diagrams"
msgstr "电机顺序图"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:29
#: d7e49ee58b02463b8f3af8404885c9dd
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Connect ESCs and Motors <connect-escs-and-motors>` page for "
"the list of supported multicopter frames"
msgstr "支持的多旋翼机架列表请参见 :ref:`连接 ESC 和电机 <connect-escs-and-motors>` 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:32
#: 1031faf0281f49d991a9eea15b651ac5
msgid "Traditional Helicopters"
msgstr "传统直升机"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:34
#: 0df9eb6e640946109cbae7bc0d619764
msgid ""
"Traditional Helicopters run a different version of firmware. See "
":ref:`traditional-helicopters` for setup and tuning information."
msgstr "传统直升机运行不同版本的固件。设置和调参信息请参见 :ref:`traditional-helicopters`。"

#: ../../source/docs/frame-type-configuration.rst:36
#: d75586e554d845bfade87ad5291569ca
msgid ""
"HeliQuads are a hybrid frame using Traditional Helicopter firmware but four "
"motors."
msgstr "HeliQuad 是使用传统直升机固件但配备四个电机的混合机架。"

